{
 "_about": "The token tree build_tokens.py turns into tokens.json. arket.com is a Next.js + Tailwind v4 storefront declaring its whole design language in the @theme layer: the --color-* palette (beige, ink, grey ramp, alert and campaign hues), the --spacing-*/--text-*/--leading-*/--radius-*/--tracking-*/--container-* scales, the --ease-*/--default-transition-* motion tokens and the arketSansMono/arketSCSansMono families. The light set holds the site's roles; measured values that no variable declares (button and drawer sizes) come from raw/components-computed.json. \"var\" leaves resolve through the live document; \"value\" leaves are measured.",
